Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}The greatest benefit of the\NCovenant is this, 'Salvation'\Nmeans our eternal salvation, and\N'desire' means our daily needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}Receiving both your daily needs\Nand your eternal salvation in a\Nsingle divine package, that is the\Ntrue power of the Covenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}For those living in the Covenant,\Naccording to God's perfect plan\Nand purpose divinely designed by\Nthe Holy Spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}The divine experience and divine\Nprotection happening here at\NKreupasanam is an immensely\Npowerful Covenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}Because our Blessed Mother is its\Ninitiator and the Intercessor of\Nthis Covenant, it is rightfully\Nknown as a Marian Covenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}Making Christ an integral part of\Nthe solution to human material\Nlack is a profound Marian\Nperspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}That is exactly why Jesus' mother\Nsaid to Him that they have no\Nwine, pointing out to the world\Nthat Jesus is the One to whom our\Nlack must be presented.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}It is Mary who reveals this to the\Nworld, because Mary treasured\Nthese divine mysteries in her\Nheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:01:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}What did Mary treasure in her\Nheart? I often ask myself this\Nquestion, and the Holy Spirit\Ncontinually affirms to me: 'Jesus\Nis everything.'
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}She is the chosen woman to whom\Nthe divine mysteries of God's\Nincarnation were first entrusted\Nin salvation history.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.00,0:01:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}Our Blessed Mother, blessed and\Ngiven the divine path by God,\Nholds the complete revelation of\Nexactly who Jesus is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}That is why, when this lack\Noccurred, the mother of Jesus told\NHim that they have no wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}Whatever happens in our lives\Nwithin the Marian Covenant, just\Nlike at the wedding in Cana, your\NMother will continually intercede\Nfor you to Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}Until you receive your miracle,\NMother Mary will remain the\Nvigilant guardian of your\NCovenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}That is why Doing exactly as He\Ncommands is the essence of the\NMarian Mission, and it is firmly\Nin this Marian Mission that we\Nstand today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(180,180)}May God abundantly bless us to\Ncarry this out meaningfully and\Nvibrantly. In the Name of the\NFather, and of the Son, and of the\NHoly Spirit.